sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (Next.js web)
    participant C as AuthController
    participant AG as AccessTokenGuard
    participant TG as TenantGuard
    participant RG as RolesGuard
    participant PG as PermissionGuard
    participant AC as AcademicScopeService
    participant M as Feature Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    B->>C: GET /content + Cookie + x-institute-id + (x-csrf-token on writes)
    Note over AG,PG: Guard chain: AccessToken → Tenant → Roles → Permission
    AG->>DB: verify JWT (HS256, 15 min) + session row live + user status active
    DB-->>AG: session + user status
    AG-->>C: request.user = { userId }
    TG->>DB: getMembership(userId, x-institute-id, membership + institute active)
    DB-->>TG: membership + roles
    TG-->>C: request.tenant = { instituteId, membershipId, roles }
    RG->>RG: @RequiredRoles against tenant.roles (OR, optional)
    PG->>DB: grantKeysForMembership (permissions DB-fresh, never from JWT)
    DB-->>PG: granted keys (manage implies action)
    PG->>AC: resolveScope(membershipId)
    AC-->>PG: whole-institute (admin) or subject-set
    C->>M: service call scoped by tenant.instituteId
    M->>DB: queries filtered by institute_id + academic scope predicate
    DB-->>M: rows (tenant + scope scoped)
    M-->>C: response
    C-->>B: 200 JSON